<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">06072026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Russian missiles struck four apartment blocks in Kyiv's historic Podil district overnight, killing three people and wounding eight, only days after the deadliest strike on the capital this year.</s> <s>Even as the missiles fell, Washington confirmed Trump and Putin had spoken for ninety minutes... and would talk again after next week's NATO summit.</s> <s>The gap between that diplomacy and the dead in Podil is the war's cruelest arithmetic.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Fiji has become Australia's third treaty ally in seventy-five years, signing a mutual-defence pact that commits each to act against a common danger if either is attacked.</s> <s>For a small Pacific island state, that's a decision to convert its geography into leverage between Beijing and the West.</s> <s>Whether other Pacific nations follow Fiji into the pact, which stays open to them, will shape who holds the ocean.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India's Election Commission has struck millions of names from its voter rolls, cutting more than two million in Odisha alone and eight percent of Sikkim's register.</s> <s>The commission calls it a routine revision, but who is erased from a register decides who can vote.</s> <s>Those cut have until the fourth of August to file objections before the final lists are set.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>France's Emmanuel Macron has arrived in Damascus, the first Western European leader to visit Syria since two thousand nine.</s> <s>He came with investors, months after hosting Syria's new president Ahmad al-Sharaa in Paris and pushing to lift sanctions.</s> <s>A café bombing that killed ten just days earlier tested al-Sharaa's grip before Macron's plane even landed.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Pakistan-administered Kashmir, police and protesters clashed as a shutdown strike gripped the territory, injuring around a dozen people in Dadyal.</s> <s>Authorities have jailed one hundred forty-seven activists of the Joint Awami Action Committee since banning the group last month, turning a cost-of-living movement into a test of constitutional rights.</s> <s>The committee has given the government until the eighth of July before it escalates.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>An energy expert has urged Nigeria's President Bola Tinubu to sell off all four of the country's state-owned refineries.</s> <s>Together they can process four hundred forty-five thousand barrels a day, yet they've sat largely idle for decades despite billions of public dollars poured into them.</s> <s>He wants a transparent auction finished within a year, though whether the government will surrender that patronage is another matter.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Saudi Arabia is courting private investors for a hundred thirty-five million dollar ferris wheel near Medina, one of Islam's holiest cities.</s> <s>The kingdom wants to capture leisure spending from pilgrimage traffic, part of its long push to diversify beyond oil.</s> <s>No bidding deadline has been named, leaving open how far commerce will reshape the approaches to the sacred.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Mount Etna sent an ash column a kilometre and a half above its crater, prompting Italy's geophysics institute to raise the aviation alert to red.</s> <s>That's the threshold at which drifting ash can melt inside jet engines and blind their sensors, so Catania's airspace stayed shut.</s> <s>The cloud drifts south, and flights resume only once the mountain quiets.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A review of twenty-seven studies has found troubling gaps in how well pneumococcal vaccines protect people without a working spleen.</s> <s>Those patients face outsized odds of overwhelming infection, which makes vaccination their main line of defence.</s> <s>Yet researchers found no solid data on the best timing for the shot around spleen removal, a gap that leaves guidelines partly guessing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A single fossil jaw fragment unearthed near Ankara is the first Eocene lizard ever described from Balkanatolia, a vanished island continent that once sat between Europe and Asia.</s> <s>Its European ancestors must have drifted across open water to reach it, tens of millions of years ago.</s> <s>Read closely, one grooved tooth becomes the record of a sea crossing no one witnessed.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>On Indonesia's Flores island, new evidence suggests the tiny hominins known as hobbits scavenged Komodo dragon kills rather than hunting their own.</s> <s>Cut marks in the cave of Liang Bua show they ate raw meat, while the charring there came from modern humans who arrived much later.</s> <s>The finding chips away at the idea that Homo floresiensis could make fire at all.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Astronomers have found a pocket of unexpectedly calm gas near the violent centre of the Milky Way.</s> <s>Gas there usually churns too fast to collapse, yet this sheltered pocket shows how stars still manage to ignite amid the turbulence.</s> <s>Researchers are now mapping how common such quiet havens are around the galactic core.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Yield-bearing stablecoins are projected to more than triple past fifty billion dollars this year, according to the asset manager 21Shares.</s> <s>Analysts warn the advertised interest means little... what decides which tokens survive a shock is the quality of the reserves behind them.</s> <s>Holders chasing the highest rate may be quietly rotating into the thinnest collateral.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Six silver spheres have washed up along a single stretch of Queensland's Forrest Beach, and a space archaeologist believes they're pressurised fuel tanks from a discarded rocket stage.</s> <s>As launches multiply, hardware falling back to Earth is becoming a routine hazard rather than a freak event.</s> <s>Authorities warn more may wash ashore in the coming days, their origin still unconfirmed.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The American bill known as the <sub alias="Clarity">CLARITY</sub> Act, meant to settle whether securities or commodities regulators oversee crypto tokens, blew past its early-July signing target.</s> <s>With the congressional calendar shrinking before recess, the measure that would end years of jurisdictional limbo now risks dying this year.</s> <s>A shift in either chamber at the midterms could force the whole thing rewritten.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>